lines = PackedStringArray("Timber!", "Every log on that pile has a story. Mostly about splinters.", "Nothing beats the smell of fresh-cut pine.", "The woods go on a long way. Then they stop.", "Fetched water from the well this morning. Twice.", "Timber Hollow's fire is the warmest in town. Don't tell the tavern.")
